// What this engine alone decides about an OpenArm v2. Its limbs, joints and
// cameras come from the robot's description, through sim_robot_core's entry
// of the same name, and its MuJoCo model, servo gains and weight compensation
// from the release of Waldo's catalogue the base image bakes.
{
  // The model ships no light, so rendering adds the engine's light rig.
  camera_lights: true,
}
